    kg:text """Figure 2 Effect of Empagliflozin on the Pharmacokinetics of Various Medications as Displayed as 90% Confidence Interval of Geometric Mean AUC and  Cmax Ratios [reference lines indicate 100% (80% - 125%)]

Geometric  mean ratio  (90% confidence interval)

<!-- image -->

| Antidiabetic drugs   | Metformin, 1000 mg, twice daily"          | AUC Cmax   |
|----------------------|-------------------------------------------|------------|
