    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "c7fcd4bf36143999341e8dabc7e286a9f08bc41938ae36f5b45cecdc6aad1c7a" ;
    kg:text """-   The CRM system is connected-and the heart is at the center of it all
-   Reducing the risk of CV death should be a priority for all patients with CRM conditions
-   Your patients are depending on you for protection

*This is internal, aspirational campaign language. Please do not use this copy in external materials. † JARDIANCE provides broad protection by reducing risk for people living with CKD, HF, or T2D with eCVD.

JARDIANCE is the heart of protection

-   JARDIANCE has been protecting † patients for 10 years
-   The benefits of JARDIANCE have been proven across multiple trials""" ;
    kg:token_count 148 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1840a433-69dc-4871-a312-95565bd55a23> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "1840a433-69dc-4871-a312-95565bd55a23" ;
    kg:chunk_index 193 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 57 ;
    kg:section_id "245357da-52a3-477c-b1fd-35a0a881d22d" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "d641a4b576a4469e6b252f13c17b4581a2532123a49ec884ed3d2bee4e97d60e" ;
    kg:text """The 'Pinnacle of Protection' is internal language, not to be shared with external audiences. It is also not a tagline for any of our communication materials.

tagline use in external communication The JARDIANCE brand values and personality remain steadfast; however, the brand promise instills a new spirit of confidence, capturing the essence of what JARDIANCE stands for and ensuring that our customers perceive it clearly.

While we won't use the phrase 'Pinnacle of Protection' in any external communication, it should guide us in everything we do for JARDIANCE.

You can expect key communications that will bring the brand promise to life in our new creative campaign (debuting in 2023). The spirit of the brand promise, however, goes beyond creative to embody all aspects of the brand.""" ;
    kg:token_count 198 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:18ec6c4a-2f9c-44a4-8fc2-75b6079c6d89> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
