    kg:source_hash "69346747a9d13b76767b488fbca081683ca815818997831380fa069a1c8895aa" ;
    kg:text """other medicine that can also lower blood sugar. The dose of your sulfonylurea or insulin may need to be lowered. Symptoms of low blood sugar may include:
- headache
- drowsiness
- weakness
- dizziness
- confusion
- irritability
- hunger
- fast heartbeat
- sweating
- shaking or feeling jittery

