    kg:source_document_id "c66d5608-a1a9-4ea5-8044-6599b515b904" ;
    kg:source_document_type "disease_brochure" ;
    kg:source_file_name "CKD_Brochure.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "09767a693228ac71092bb4ce79cba5e41e8978f77d15195b58d0a2afb8f7a0eb" ;
    kg:text """Do not take JARDIANCE if you are allergic to empagliflozin or any of the ingredients in JARDIANCE.

Symptoms of a serious allergic reaction may include:

- rash
-   raised, red areas on your skin (hives)
-   swelling of your face, lips, mouth, and throat that may cause difficulty in breathing or swallowing

If you have any of these symptoms, stop taking JARDIANCE and call your healthcare provider right away or go to the nearest hospital emergency room.

Please see additional Important Safety Information for JARDIANCE throughout, and Prescribing Information and Medication Guide.""" ;
    kg:token_count 146 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1f798732-7a4f-4455-a9f4-cbfa3689aee3> a kg:Chunk ;
