    kg:source_hash "ed311f809eb2fe988150bc83d492ba1cda0be0310b220748e1c1006939efd582" ;
    kg:text "The safety profile in patients with chronic kidney disease was generally consistent with that observed across the studied indications. In a long-term cardio-renal outcome trial [see Clinical Studies 14.5] , in patients with chronic kidney disease, the occurrence of lower limb amputations was reported with event rates of 2.9, and 4.3 events per 1,000 patient-years in the placebo, and JARDIANCE 10 mg treatment arms, respectively [see Warnings and Precautions (5.5)]." ;
    kg:token_count 117 .

