    kg:text """- x Pregnancy: Advise females of the potential risk to a fetus especially during the second and third trimesters. (8.1)
- x Lactation: Not recommended when breastfeeding. (8.2)
- x Geriatric Patients: Higher incidence of adverse reactions related to volume depletion and reduced renal function. (8.5)
- x Renal Impairment: Higher incidence of adverse reactions related to reduced renal function. (8.6)

See 17 for PATIENT COUNSELING INFORMATION and Medication Guide.

