    kg:source_hash "3fc39c4a13bb79f7057c90ca339a0a9b12396d82eebc98e89f99142b0208190f" ;
    kg:text """dney disease, or who are taking or have recently received certain types of immunosuppressive therapy to treat kidney disease. JARDIANCE is not expected to work if you have these conditions.

It is not known if JARDIANCE is safe and effective in children under 10 years of age.""" ;
    kg:token_count 69 .

