    kg:text """The power of colour is often underestimated in branding. Different colours and different combinations of colours cause different emotional and psychologic reactions.

The JARDIANCE brand colour palette is a strong reflection of the proactive, brave, and energising personality of the brand. It uses a combination of high-contrasting colours: teal, yellow, and brown.

Codes for each colour and/or gradient range are provided within each colour swatch.""" ;
    kg:token_count 113 .

