    kg:text """Assessment of renal function is recommended as follows:

- -Prior to empagliflozin initiation and periodically during treatment, i.e. at least yearly (see sections 4.2, 4.8, 5.1 and 5.2).
- -Prior to initiation of any concomitant medicinal product that may have a negative impact on renal function.""" ;
