    kg:source_hash "e4f1724d88846ced107372db57cdcacbd111a2c0e9212ab75b198789a2924fd3" ;
    kg:text """The crystallised brand promise is a fixed branding element. Even if the wording of the crystallised brand promise changes (eg, due to a change in positioning), where it is placed in the logo cluster does not change.

The GLYXAMBI logotype and registration mark appear in teal (PMS 321C).

<!-- image -->

The symbol appears in brown (PMS 411C), teal (PMS 321C), and magenta (PMS 219C).

The generic name appears in brown (PMS 411C).

To ensure brand consistency across all markets, the logo cluster must not be altered.""" ;
    kg:token_count 130 .

