<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8f9a1a45-fee2-4567-b2c2-429539306324> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "8f9a1a45-fee2-4567-b2c2-429539306324" ;
    kg:chunk_index 77 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 23 ;
    kg:section_id "d0465fbf-e1bf-468e-a0fb-627399ac4c3a" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "e844453e001bc00127652ffc97aa66623c47c9bc7ee567656ba5945995b74d0f" ;
    kg:text """The global branding system concept, 'Layers that run deep,' proudly promotes that the further you delve into the JARDIANCE proposition, the more depth and richness you will uncover.

<!-- image -->

That depth and richness includes benefits beyond the physical and traditional concerns of T2D and heart failure to include renal, as well as emotional, worries.

In addition to the logo, typography, symbol, colours, and colour environment, the JARDIANCE branding system utilises visual styling, a set of illustrative, visual layers and graphic treatments to represent the boundless depth of the JARDIANCE brand offering. The JARDIANCE branding elements involve layering with purpose and simplicity and utilise the brand colours to engage with various audiences.

Through its consistent, purposeful application on and beyond the printed page, the branding system helps to draw in the audience to engage with and foster a more enduring and meaningful emotional connection with the JARDIANCE brand.""" ;
    kg:token_count 248 .

