|                                                    | 18 weeks (no insulin adjustment)   | 18 weeks (no insulin adjustment)   | 18 weeks (no insulin adjustment)   | 78 weeks (adjustable insulin dose after 18 weeks)   | 78 weeks (adjustable insulin dose after 18 weeks)   | 78 weeks (adjustable insulin dose after 18 weeks)   |
|----------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------|------------------------------------|------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
|                                                    | JARDIANCE 10 m""" ;
