    kg:section_id "47449479-3aa8-43ae-9a37-fcacdc51ce2d" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "657dac75129ca09bf990835a3e8f6730314d0126f3a7f101e01a3d48b0b2a1aa" ;
    kg:text """djunct to diet and exercise to improve glycemic control in type 2 diabetes mellitus.

The safety and effectiveness of JARDIANCE have not been established in pediatric patients to reduce the risk of:

- x cardiovascular death and hospitalization for heart failure in patients with heart failure.
- x sustained decline in eGFR, end-stage kidney disease, cardiovascular death, and hospitalization in patients with chronic kidney disease at risk of progression.
- x cardiovascular death in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus and established cardiovascular disease.""" ;
    kg:token_count 141 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:a89b83af-4978-47ee-bf2d-f0aea7d370a0> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "a89b83af-4978-47ee-bf2d-f0aea7d370a0" ;
    kg:chunk_index 107 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 20 ;
    kg:section_id "deeb8f74-74d8-4212-bde8-2cef7ade32c7" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "45d7ea81f30876cf7a6387bb7c7307a62d928508708fed881a29121a789ddbc8" ;
    kg:text """JARDIANCE has been studied as monotherapy and in combination with metformin, sulfonylurea, pioglitazone, linagliptin, and insulin.  JARDIANCE has also been studied in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus with mild or moderate renal impairment.

In adult patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus, treatment with JARDIANCE reduced hemoglobin A1c (HbA1c), compared to placebo. The reduction in HbA1c for JARDIANCE compared with placebo was observed across subgroups including sex, race, geographic region, baseline BMI and duration of disease.""" ;
    kg:token_count 135 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:a90ce898-062b-4735-bd5b-21f32aafc59a> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "a90ce898-062b-4735-bd5b-21f32aafc59a" ;
    kg:chunk_index 262 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 51 ;
    kg:section_id "978bd0ee-8b17-43a8-b0e1-9d589afb53ae" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "a50acd567215571f58bd1efe7c5ae51d43f86d06421d4e77f4eded366d165efc" ;
    kg:text """Jardiance has minor influence on the ability to drive and use machines.

Taking this medicine in combination with medicines called sulphonylureas or with insulin can cause blood sugar levels to drop too low (hypoglycaemia), which may cause symptoms such as shaking, sweating and change in vision, and may affect your ability to drive and use machines. Do not drive or use any tools or machines, if you feel dizzy while taking Jardiance.""" ;
    kg:token_count 109 .

