<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:ad8a6e97-fe65-4803-88da-8af832ce383d> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "ad8a6e97-fe65-4803-88da-8af832ce383d" ;
    kg:chunk_index 224 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 67 ;
    kg:section_id "66ad13f4-f620-4999-8bdd-31026196938b" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "f31741489c33a4389884ca54fd418f7ee6416c9fda04878782192f316e26fd41" ;
    kg:text """The global branding system applies to the 'JARDIANCE family' in a way that visually depicts the relationship between the Boehringer Ingelheim/Lilly Alliance and among its related product brands in the Diabetes Portfolio.

There are 3 products that comprise the JARDIANCE family, with JARDIANCE being the lead brand and SYNJARDY and GLYXAMBI as line extensions:

- JARDIANCE ®  (empagliflozin)
- SYNJARDY ®  (empagliflozin/metformin HCl)
- GLYXAMBI ®  (empagliflozin/linagliptin)

This section highlights the specific JARDIANCE family branding elements, explains the rationale behind them, and provides detailed instructions for approved use to ensure consistency throughout all communications.

<!-- image -->

Keep in mind that when any of the family brands are used in combination with JARDIANCE, the JARDIANCE branding elements (eg, colour, environment, page architecture) must be adhered to.

Important: please note that the Boehringer Ingelheim/Lilly Alliance is not currently pursuing future heart failure or chronic kidney disease indications for SYNJARDY or GLYXAMBI. There are no updates to design or branding on family brands.""" ;
    kg:token_count 284 .

