<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:afc2476a-8c16-4613-a08c-a43576660c3a> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_Claims_updated & Content Modules 1.xlsx" ;
    kg:chunk_id "afc2476a-8c16-4613-a08c-a43576660c3a" ;
    kg:chunk_index 42 ;
    kg:extraction_method "openpyxl" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 1 ;
    kg:section_id "f9f1c2ed-a62f-44e4-b02c-6fa39df42688" ;
    kg:source_document_id "e77ccb64-a3a2-41c2-9027-fb5e54716ebc" ;
    kg:source_document_type "claims_content_modules" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_Claims_updated & Content Modules 1.xlsx" ;
    kg:source_hash "3c572bbed17cbdb1c68dacfcc1d0cf980e164faeeb9c2a93d74355c5fe7351a3" ;
    kg:text "Corporate | Brand: JARDIANCE | Therapeutic Area: Metabolism | Lifecycle State: Approved for Use | Key Message Type: Efficacy | Footnotes: In the EMPEROR-Preserved trial, a randomised, double-blind, parallel-group, placebo-controlled study of 5988 patients with HFpEF, the efficacy and safety profile of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=2997) was evaluated vs placebo (n=2991). Patients were adults with chronic heart failure (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and preserved ejection fraction (LVEF > 40%). The primary endpoint in the EMPEROR-Preserved trial was a composite of CV death or HHF, analysed as time to the first event. Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 21% RRR in this endpoint (HR=0.79; 95% CI: 0.69, 0.90; p<0.001).  Results of prespecified subgroup analyses in the EMPEROR-Preserved trial. Diabetes at baseline (HR=0.79; 95% CI: 0.67, 0.94); no diabetes at baseline (HR=0.78; 95% CI: 0.64, 0.95). eGFR (CKD-EPI) ≥ 60 mL/min/1.73 m2 at baseline (HR=0.81; 95% CI: 0.65, 1.00); eGFR (CKD-EPI) < 60 mL/min/1.73 m2 at baseline (HR=0.78; 95% CI: 0.66, 0.91).  CI=confidence interval;  CKD=chronic kidney disease; CKD-EPI=Chronic Kidney Disease Epidemiology Collaboration; CV=cardiovascular; eGFR=esti" ;
    kg:token_count 300 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b085cd39-f30f-43be-8bb7-2247ef5ba9a9> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:chunk_id "b085cd39-f30f-43be-8bb7-2247ef5ba9a9" ;
    kg:chunk_index 250 ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 50 ;
    kg:section_id "7f4bc599-9777-4a56-b4a2-0107e3fafb23" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "9943539299a586d046c13e4f01cd5c908f36598093f9f387fa07d79912cfeed4" ;
    kg:text """Heart failure occurs when the heart is too weak or stiff and cannot work properly. This can lead to serious medical problems and need for hospital care. The most common symptoms of heart failure are feeling breathless, feeling tired or very tired all the time, and ankle swelling.

Jardiance helps protect your heart from getting weaker and improves your symptoms.""" ;
    kg:token_count 91 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b096e5f3-9c65-4789-9933-7839be4b7acf> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
