    kg:text """The boundless nature of JARDIANCE comes through in multiple areas. For example, JARDIANCE is boundless in its vision, its performance, its potential, and in the possibilities it provides to its patients.

<!-- image -->

At its core, JARDIANCE is BOUNDLESS-defined as vast, limitless, and without boundaries.""" ;
