    kg:source_hash "a7b9475660f06f3376a9ab888be8eaf8dd554b400d4c888fbf1e8d7b2cae60c7" ;
    kg:text "The colour environment includes not just the individual colours but also the relationship or ratio between the colours within the palette. For example, 2 brands may feature blue as a primary colour, but 1 brand may saturate the page in blue while the other may feature mostly white space punctuated by minimal blue accents. Same colour, very different colour environments. This is part of what makes the brand instantly recognisable and truly differentiated from its competitors." ;
