    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 56 ;
    kg:section_id "e6b8a4f1-90d9-43d2-abae-f79dc54e813e" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "fab53785a49106e173b5f7b8df1c006fd9850f753dace1a2d00ed83f86427018" ;
    kg:text """The crystallised brand promise, as its name implies, is the distillation of the JARDIANCE positioning statement into a short, memorable phrase. Indications and data have been added over the last several years to the JARDIANCE brand story. With its broadening impact and potential, JARDIANCE is also gaining complexity, making it even more important that we express what the brand stands for with complete clarity. Recent market research across stakeholders and countries has identified one key territory.

This key territory is protection . * Protection unites individual indications to form a leadership position that ensures one global execution in the minds of our prescribers. It is a legacy of protection that helps to bring together our current indications while also allowing for new data and indications to come.""" ;
    kg:token_count 205 .

