    kg:source_hash "ba56880d809f45eeeac8d9e532f1d0f06a0a018db448f616840a8e8b706f6ced" ;
    kg:text """The permanent behaviour that never changes. Identifying DNA allows us to craft an eventual brand character that is authentic .

<!-- image -->

The authentic brand character is not to be shared verbatim with external audiences, but is intended to shape all interactions related to the brand .

The brand character is defined as the set of human attributes and characteristics associated with the brand, giving it a unique persona in the market and in the mind of the customer. It comprises the following elements: brand values and purpose, DNA, archetype, and personality.""" ;
    kg:token_count 143 .

