    kg:source_hash "9480367313434813c3ceda51fadebc89a79682a98aad7b79f59488b20a776f6f" ;
    kg:text """Typography refers to more than just the choice of font-it includes how that font is used (eg, type compositions) in the headline and throughout copy.

JARDIANCE uses the Lato font, which can be found on Google Fonts. This font can be used in both print and digital tactics and has differentiated letterforms that enhance legibility.

<!-- image -->

Lato ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->

1234567890(.,;:?!£$&amp;@*)

Aa

Please note, for PowerPoint presentations, the Arial font should be used to avoid any issues across computer platforms.""" ;
    kg:token_count 148 .

