    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:source_hash "1a2b29836ef2fe280112415b1a0c56cbab19367ebc090fedd808472c250db80a" ;
    kg:text """Logotype refers to the typographic treatment given to the brand name.

Use teal for the JARDIANCE logotype and brown for the generic name (empagliflozin).

Never use the brand name in a possessive form (eg, 'JARDIANCE's efficacy'), and do not use the logotype in a sentence.

The JARDIANCE logotype appears in teal (PMS 321C).

The generic logotype appears in brown (PMS 411C).""" ;
    kg:token_count 94 .

