    kg:text """tion: Quantitative detail: 20% | Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.32 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.32
#: 118 | Final Corrected Claim: There were no significant differences between the placebo and JARDIANCE groups of nonfatal MI (HR=0.87; 95% CI: 0.70, 1.09; p=0.22) or nonfatal stroke (HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0.92, 1.67; p=0.16).5 ||Pooled data from 10-mg and 25-mg doses of JARDIANCE; both doses showed a comparable reduction in the risk of CV death.5 ¶Standard of care included CV medications and glucose-lowering agents given at the discretion of healthcare providers and according to recommendations of local guidelines.5 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 95%; HR=0.87; HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0; p=0.22; p=0.16 | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.""" ;
    kg:token_count 300 .

<urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:dce926e7-729d-4432-914b-5bee2addc6ba> a kg:Chunk ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
