    kg:text """While branded communications about a product promote ideas and information, they also project an emotional impression or 'character' that can influence how the information is received.

When establishing brand character, we must define what drives the brand on the inside and how it is expressed as personality on the outside-that is, how the elements relate to one another.""" ;
