    kg:source_hash "70d1ddd457c8293122261f00520e6bc14ccfa57b984ecaa644b1eb4b734507f9" ;
    kg:text """<!-- image -->

The My JARDIANCE Support™ Program is there to support you on your journey, with healthy tips, lifestyle ideas, and keeping you on track with treatment.

<!-- image -->

Save with the JARDIANCE Savings Card. With a JARDIANCE Savings Card, eligible commercially insured patients can pay $0 for a 30- to 90-day prescription. And don't worry - we'll also automatically re-enroll you after 12 months as long as you still qualify.

<!-- image -->

Get started at JARDIANCE.COM or scan this QR code.

*To view the full terms and conditions, please visit  JARDIANCE.com/savings.""" ;
    kg:token_count 146 .

