    kg:claim_status "candidate" ;
    kg:claim_text """Very common AEs: hypoglycaemia (when used with sulphonylurea or insulin). JARDIANCE has a placebo-like incidence of hypoglycaemia when added to metformin; volume 
depletion. Selected uncommon AE: diabetic ketoacidosis. Rare AE: necrotising fasciitis of the perineum (Fournier’s gangrene).""" ;
