    kg:claim_text "The 14% RRR in 3-point MACE (HR=0.86; 95% CI: 0.74, 0.99; p<0.001 for noninferiority; p=0.04 for superiority) was driven by a reduction in the risk of CV death (HR=0.62; 95% CI: 0.49, 0.77); there was no change in risk of nonfatal MI (HR=0.87; 95% CI: 0.70, 1.09) or nonfatal stroke (HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0.92, 1.67).1" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:indication "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD" ;
    kg:key_message_type "Disease education / Unmet need" ;
