    kg:section_id "0ffa8c47-f86b-4721-88cb-2c47bf438bfb" ;
    kg:section_title "About the layers of protection" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text "The Layers of Protection element features an evolved version of the page architecture to represent a holistic focus on the 3 key components of CRM protection: cardio, renal, and metabolic. It is used to emotionalise core JARDIANCE information and highlight the types of patients who the brand is able to protect." .

