    kg:page_number 42 ;
    kg:section_id "16e8cdd0-4601-48dc-846d-fe1921cdc8d4" ;
    kg:section_title "About the target patient images" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Target patient images have been created for each indication. For some indications, the target patient is available in three age variations: earlystage patient, mid-stage patient, and late-stage patient. Additional ethnic variations of each target patient are available and should be selected based on the needs and preferences of the local market. The target patient is always linked to a specific HCP customer and used to illustrate patient profiles and case studies.

<!-- image -->""" .

