<urn:kg:jardiance:section:194c9409-ba4d-4328-bf97-73a56aa8f517> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:161b5d6f-f8dd-4c7f-afd0-7676f9fe0985> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 8 ;
    kg:section_id "194c9409-ba4d-4328-bf97-73a56aa8f517" ;
    kg:section_title "JARDIANCE is the solution for patients at elevated CV risk, regardless of the cause" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """CV complications are the number one cause of death for people living with T2D and/or CKD* and/or CVD 4-7

- 40% of PCPs say JARDIANCE protects patients with elevated CV risk -better than other treatment options (including Forxiga)""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:196880d4-b9cd-44af-abbd-43021dea64ce> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Medication Guidance.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:e7fad790-dbf4-444c-b20f-bbefbfaa881f> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 2 ;
    kg:section_id "196880d4-b9cd-44af-abbd-43021dea64ce" ;
    kg:section_title "Who should not take JARDIANCE? Do not take JARDIANCE if you:" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "dd225975-2d03-4997-adf6-8e9d59ecfa0e" ;
    kg:source_document_type "medication_guide" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Medication Guidance.pdf" ;
    kg:text """- are allergic to empagliflozin or any of the ingredients in JARDIANCE.  See the end of this Medication Guide for a complete list of ingredients in JARDIANCE. Symptoms of a serious allergic reaction to JARDIANCE may include:
- o rash
- o raised, red areas on your skin (hives)
- o swelling of your face, lips, mouth, and throat that may cause difficulty in breathing or swallowing

If you have any of these symptoms, stop taking JARDIANCE and call your healthcare provider right away or go to the nearest hospital emergency room.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:196c6afe-997c-4f73-86fd-53ad9901c9a9> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Medication Guidance.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b95d1b96-65f6-4bdf-8892-bf30ad591b64> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 3 ;
    kg:section_id "196c6afe-997c-4f73-86fd-53ad9901c9a9" ;
    kg:section_title "The most common side effects of JARDIANCE include:" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "dd225975-2d03-4997-adf6-8e9d59ecfa0e" ;
    kg:source_document_type "medication_guide" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Medication Guidance.pdf" ;
    kg:text """- urinary tract infections
- yeast infections in females

These are not all the possible side effects of JARDIANCE.  For more information, ask your healthcare provider or pharmacist.

Call your doctor for medical advice about side effects.  You may report side effects to FDA at 1-800-FDA-1088.""" .

