    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The impact of JARDIANCE on the lives of patients and HCPs must be felt in the moments that matter, beyond the clinical benefit

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->

Creating this emotional connection will allow us to…

Increase engagement and advocacy Create a stronger brand connection Differentiate JARDIANCE in a crowded market""" .

