<urn:kg:jardiance:section:3d280301-e331-482f-b3a9-f2dd8668e5d3> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "CKD_Brochure.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:2fd1dac9-b61e-4504-ab86-27f4104aa897> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 3 ;
    kg:section_id "3d280301-e331-482f-b3a9-f2dd8668e5d3" ;
    kg:section_title "2. MANAGING POSSIBLE SIDE EFFECTS" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c66d5608-a1a9-4ea5-8044-6599b515b904" ;
    kg:source_document_type "disease_brochure" ;
    kg:source_file_name "CKD_Brochure.pdf" ;
    kg:text "The most common side effects with JARDIANCE are urinary tract infections and yeast infections. These are not all the possible side effects of JARDIANCE. Tell your healthcare provider if you experience these or other side effects." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:3d49f702-5f1a-4179-8011-ef47ce1d86fd> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Medication Guidance.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1fd0aaf1-526a-4a3a-96bc-9de601799ba1>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:c85d0116-8206-41aa-96d8-0d7afe09676d> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 1 ;
    kg:section_id "3d49f702-5f1a-4179-8011-ef47ce1d86fd" ;
    kg:section_title "What is JARDIANCE?" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "dd225975-2d03-4997-adf6-8e9d59ecfa0e" ;
    kg:source_document_type "medication_guide" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Medication Guidance.pdf" ;
    kg:text """JARDIANCE is a prescription medicine used to:

- o reduce the risk of cardiovascular death and hospitalization for heart failure in adults with heart failure, when the heart cannot pump enough blood to the rest of your body.
- o reduce the risk of further worsening of kidney disease, end-stage kidney disease (ESKD), death due to cardiovascular disease, and hospitalization in adults with chronic kidney disease.
- o reduce the risk of cardiovascular death in adults with type 2 diabetes and who also have known cardiovascular disease.
- o lower blood sugar (glucose) along with diet and exercise in adults and children who are 10 years of age and older with type 2 diabetes.

JARDIANCE is not for use to lower blood sugar (glucose) in people with type 1 diabetes. It may increase their risk of diabetic ketoacidosis (increased ketones in blood or urine).

JARDIANCE is not for use to lower blood sugar (glucose) in people with type 2 diabetes who have severe kidney problems, because it may not work.

JARDIANCE is not for people with polycystic kidney disease, or who are taking or have recently received certain types of immunosuppressive therapy to treat kidney disease. JARDIANCE is not expected to work if you have these conditions.

It is not known if JARDIANCE is safe and effective in children under 10 years of age.""" .

