    kg:section_id "504e9008-c52e-4c6e-b4dc-f06d028aa725" ;
    kg:section_title "Urinary tract infection:" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c66d5608-a1a9-4ea5-8044-6599b515b904" ;
    kg:source_document_type "disease_brochure" ;
    kg:source_file_name "CKD_Brochure.pdf" ;
    kg:text """- burning feeling when you urinate
- need to urinate often or right away
- pain in the lower part of your stomach (pelvis)
- blood in your urine

You may also have a fever, back pain, nausea, or vomiting.""" .

