    kg:section_id "58b5f5b0-a9b6-4cd5-9631-4c9b79484464" ;
    kg:section_title "The JARDIANCE global branding system" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """-   Conveys that there are more layers to JARDIANCE than originally thought
-   Works on multiple levels , addresses multiple problems, and is concerned about more than just the one-sided physical dysfunction of T2D, HF, and/or CKD
-   Focusing on this idea, and going through the effort of bringing it to life beyond the printed page (ie, creating actual experiences), builds deeper and more meaningful emotional connections with our audience""" .

