<urn:kg:jardiance:section:9d261577-0b74-4259-93c3-d08274d76938> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:bd615138-3521-4e1d-badd-196cba59221a> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 26 ;
    kg:section_id "9d261577-0b74-4259-93c3-d08274d76938" ;
    kg:section_title "The JARDIANCE symbol reflects boundless depth" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The layered angles and curves of the JARDIANCE symbol come together as a reminder that JARDIANCE is a brand with boundless depth and richness.

These layers, which run deep in the symbol, were the inspiration for other elements of the JARDIANCE global branding system. Therefore, the symbol serves as a true foundation that strengthens the JARDIANCE branding as a whole.

On closer examination, you can see that the flowing, curved contours sweep the sides of the symbol, giving it a smooth and inviting, organic shape. Lines converge, carving sharp angles that give the symbol a crisp, energised feeling.""" .

