<urn:kg:jardiance:section:bf4f0bfc-226c-4422-abb3-b24a016dcd89> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:9ecfc3dd-3992-4f56-aef2-fd83eb05af11> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 5 ;
    kg:section_id "bf4f0bfc-226c-4422-abb3-b24a016dcd89" ;
    kg:section_title "JARDIANCE ®  is the early and foundational treatment" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """to improve outcomes for all people living with T2D, CKD, and/or CVD* †

The proven cardiovascular benefits ‡  of JARDIANCE position it as a trusted and foundational choice across the CRM spectrum CV complications are the main cause of death in over 1 billion people who live with CRM conditions globally, highlighting the urgent need for early and foundational interventions like JARDIANCE

JARDIANCE provides broad protection by reducing risk for people living with CKD, HF , or T2D with eCVD.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:c1a57f06-c8ff-4a70-8b7c-eb272accdf6b> a kg:Section ;
