    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """It can be difficult to treat beyond the primary disease I see in front of me, and knowing the best treatment options can be difficult. I'm also not convinced that there is a difference between SGLT2is.

<!-- image -->

HCPs know that they need to protect patients-citing JARDIANCE as a resource that helps protect their patients †""" .

