<urn:kg:jardiance:section:c54b0ff4-55a0-4302-8363-bb00fd01d785> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "CKD_Brochure.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:f2041f00-b85b-40fa-b705-dc6d65abffa8> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 5 ;
    kg:section_id "c54b0ff4-55a0-4302-8363-bb00fd01d785" ;
    kg:section_title "SUPPORT EVERY STEP OF THE WAY" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "c66d5608-a1a9-4ea5-8044-6599b515b904" ;
    kg:source_document_type "disease_brochure" ;
    kg:source_file_name "CKD_Brochure.pdf" ;
    kg:text """<!-- image -->

The My JARDIANCE Support™ Program is there to support you on your journey, with healthy tips, lifestyle ideas, and keeping you on track with treatment.

<!-- image -->

Save with the JARDIANCE Savings Card. With a JARDIANCE Savings Card, eligible commercially insured patients can pay $0 for a 30- to 90-day prescription. And don't worry - we'll also automatically re-enroll you after 12 months as long as you still qualify.

<!-- image -->

Get started at JARDIANCE.COM or scan this QR code.

*To view the full terms and conditions, please visit  JARDIANCE.com/savings.""" .

