    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Classic psychologic disposition that categorises how individuals will always relate to the world . Identifying the archetype helps establish the territory within which our final brand character will reside.

<!-- image -->""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d090d756-c67b-42ff-8c5b-b13a8ba56395> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:3c3381a0-243a-4420-bcb6-4d173863614a> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 56 ;
    kg:section_id "d090d756-c67b-42ff-8c5b-b13a8ba56395" ;
    kg:section_title "The Pinnacle of Protection †" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """*Protection does not equate to prevention.

†  Never to be used externally. Please see next page.

Being at the pinnacle or top means that others look to JARDIANCE for leadership and inspiration. It means that JARDIANCE can stand on its legacy and data to confidently speak to HCPs about the benefits that come with a JARDIANCE prescription. It means that any new data and indications will help JARDIANCE stand even taller.

The crystallised brand promise is a clear and simple summation of the brand positioning.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d0a2a239-eb28-4f04-a9b4-c4e3973aa168> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
