    kg:section_title "Symbol" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The symbol is a graphic element created to embody and project a relevant aspect of the brand.

The GLYXAMBI symbol mirrors that of JARDIANCE in its curves, angles, and boundless depth.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d1167e88-1a95-45b7-a3a8-e1cdddc99012> a kg:Section ;
