    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """JARDIANCE is focused on achieving the best possible future .

It is not: Aggressive, short-sighted, focused on instant wins, inconsiderate.""" .

