    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Committed to progressing beyond what was thought possible, JARDIANCE frees others from their burdens and liberates the greatness within so they can live their best lives.

<!-- image -->

The JARDIANCE archetype personified 'For to be free is not merely to cast off one's chains, but to live in a way that respects and enhances the freedom of others.' -Nelson Mandela""" .

