    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """- One in orange
- The other in teal

The brown tint gives the elements a layered effect.

For more information about the 'Layers that run deep' global branding system, please see page 20.

The SYNJARDY symbol

Orange PMS 716C C0/M65/Y100/K0 R244/G121/B32 #EC7700

Brown PMS 411C C30/M38/Y34/K70 R75/G50/B50 #4B3232

Teal PMS 321C C100/M0/Y45/K10 R0/G140/B125 #008C7D""" .

