    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Table 18 Treatment Effect for the Primary Composite Endpoint, its Components and Key Secondary Endpoints

|                                                                                                                                          | Placebo N=3,305        | JARDIANCE 10 mg N=3,304   | Hazard ratio vs placebo (95% CI)   | p-value   |
|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------|---------------------------|------------------------------------|-----------|
|                                                                                                                                          | Number of Patients (%) | Number of Patients (%)    |                                    |           |
| Composite of sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline, sustained eGFR <10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , ESKD a , or CV or renal death (time to first occurrence) | 558 (16.9)             | 432 (13.1)                | 0.72 (0.64, 0.82)                  | <0.0001   |
| Sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline                                                                                                             | 474 (14.3)             | 359 (10.9)                | 0.70 (0.61, 0.81)                  |           |
| ESKD a or sustained eGFR <10 mL/min/1.73 m 2                                                                                             | 221 (6.7)              | 157 (4.8)                 | 0.69 (0.56, 0.84)                  |           |
| Renal death b                                                                                                                            | 4 (0.1)                | 4 (0.1)                   |                                    |           |
| CV death                                                                                                                                 | 69 (2.1)               | 59 (1.8)                  | 0.84 (0.60, 1.19)                  |           |
|                                                                                                                                          | Number of Events       | Number of Events          |                                    |           |
| First and recurrent hospitalization c                                                                                                    | 1,895                  | 1,611                     | 0.86 (0.78, 0.95)                  | 0.0025    |

Figure 13 Time to First Occurrence of the Primary Composite Endpoint, Sustained ≥ 40% eGFR Decline, Sustained eGFR &lt;10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , ESKD or Renal Death, or CV Death

<!-- image -->""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:3c9b6332-bb41-46b7-858d-cb977099078f> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8464e75f-e0d6-40b6-9d96-63016ff29d6e> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 52 ;
    kg:section_id "3c9b6332-bb41-46b7-858d-cb977099078f" ;
    kg:section_title "If you forget to take Jardiance" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """What to do if you forget to take a tablet depends on how long it is until your next dose.

- If it is 12 hours or more until your next dose, take Jardiance as soon as you remember. Then take your next dose at the usual time.
- If it is less than 12 hours until your next dose, skip the missed dose. Then take your next dose at the usual time.
- Do not take a double dose of Jardiance to make up for a forgotten dose.""" .

