<urn:kg:jardiance:section:409f26f4-13b1-45dd-908b-57094b2443c9> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:c896a199-33b9-4b42-a16c-2df45a3b98fd> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 24 ;
    kg:section_id "409f26f4-13b1-45dd-908b-57094b2443c9" ;
    kg:section_title "2-hour post-prandial glucose" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text "Treatment with empagliflozin as add-on to metformin or metformin and a sulphonylurea resulted in a clinically meaningful reduction of 2-hour post-prandial glucose (meal tolerance test) at 24 weeks (add-on to metformin: placebo +5.9 mg/dL, empagliflozin 10 mg: -46.0 mg/dL, empagliflozin 25 mg: -44.6 mg/dL, add-on to metformin and a sulphonylurea: placebo -2.3 mg/dL, empagliflozin 10 mg: -35.7 mg/dL, empagliflozin 25 mg: -36.6 mg/dL)." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:4108c328-e013-4b32-8dd6-9c87d990eeb6> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8ef5f428-bb1a-4376-bdfd-a2ce8519f6d0> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 7 ;
    kg:section_id "4108c328-e013-4b32-8dd6-9c87d990eeb6" ;
    kg:section_title "Effects of empagliflozin on other medicinal products" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Empagliflozin may increase renal lithium excretion and the blood lithium levels may be decreased. Serum concentration of lithium should be monitored more frequently after empagliflozin initiation and dose changes. Please refer the patient to the lithium prescribing doctor in order to monitor serum concentration of lithium.

Based on in vitro studies, empagliflozin does not inhibit, inactivate, or induce CYP450 isoforms. Empagliflozin does not inhibit UGT1A1, UGT1A3, UGT1A8, UGT1A9, or UGT2B7. Drug-drug interactions involving the major CYP450 and UGT isoforms with empagliflozin and concomitantly administered substrates of these enzymes are therefore considered unlikely.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:41600d86-5631-4399-a838-4fe9f23b539c> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:5cce2706-f79e-48ed-bc01-36019fd7cc41> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 35 ;
    kg:section_id "41600d86-5631-4399-a838-4fe9f23b539c" ;
    kg:section_title "Typography: technical instructions" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """<!-- image -->

-   Use teal text for headlines and callouts on light backgrounds
-   Use brown text for body copy, references, and footnotes
-   Use knockout text on dark backgrounds
-   The JARDIANCE brand name should appear in ALL CAPS
-   For digital: always balance readability
-   For PowerPoint: always use Arial
-   Be mindful of the contrast between the colour used for the copy vs that used for the surrounding background
-   Always ensure the legibility of all text
-   All copy should be tracked at +20
- DON'T distort the font by stretching it vertically or horizontally

<!-- image -->""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:4394941f-3ac8-4009-ace0-5de9a8b205b5> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b0c48b2b-ce8f-4be1-a3fc-eb9ea778d50e> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 16 ;
    kg:section_id "4394941f-3ac8-4009-ace0-5de9a8b205b5" ;
    kg:section_title "Distribution" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text "The apparent steady-state volume of distribution was estimated to be 73.8 L based on a population pharmacokinetic analysis.  Following administration of an oral [ 14 C]-empagliflozin solution to healthy subjects, the red blood cell partitioning was approximately 36.8% and plasma protein binding was 86.2%." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:43ec580b-44f8-4117-b056-f51776740a3b> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
