    kg:text """Callouts should be used to emphasise a key statistic, close out a section of content, or guide the viewer to read more on the next page.

Callouts should be centered text housed between 2 thin yellow rules. As needed, an icon can be incorporated that connects with the content being discussed. See specific guidance below.""" .

