<urn:kg:jardiance:section:4dc7a36e-6ebe-440c-ac60-e3b566432bd5> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1a7a6753-fd03-49de-b8b6-001ec0fba26f>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:5418b230-75ed-4eee-8a21-bfc2a5d14150>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:6c2eefa1-c807-4743-8c24-33c3bc8ee200>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:91a0e70c-28e5-436e-b691-5dd236c12d31>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b65c450e-6462-4f5b-a1b9-4bce95f9b425>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:be8b4a44-5ebe-42c3-bb43-bd6ad49c4243>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:d7cfbae3-f5e5-4a3b-98ee-ae6266e33bcf> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 40 ;
    kg:section_id "4dc7a36e-6ebe-440c-ac60-e3b566432bd5" ;
    kg:section_type "body" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The results of the primary composite endpoint were consistent across the pre-specified subgroups (see Figure 12).

Figure 12 Treatment Effects for the Primary Composite Endpoint (CV Death or Hospitalization for Heart Failure) Subgroup Analysis (EMPEROR-Preserved)

| Subgroup Category          | N with event/ N analyzed   | N with event/ N analyzed   | Hazard ratio (95%CI)   | Empagliflozin 10 mg better   | Placebo better   |
|----------------------------|----------------------------|----------------------------|------------------------|------------------------------|------------------|
|                            | Empagliflozin 10 mg        | vs Placebo                 |                        |                              | -                |
| Overall                    | 415/2997                   | 511/2991                   | 0.79 (0.69,0.90)       | i-----,                      |                  |
| Diabetes at baseline       |                            |                            |                        |                              |                  |
| Diabetic                   | 239/1466                   | 291/1472                   | 0.79 (0.67,0.94)       | f----+---l                   |                  |
| Non-Diabetic               | 176/1531                   | 220/1519                   | 0.78 (0.64,0.95)       | I------+----,                |                  |
| Age                        |                            |                            |                        |                              |                  |
| <70                        | 134/1066                   | 152/1084                   | 0.88 (0.70, 1.11)      |                              |                  |
| 2:70                       | 281/1931                   | 359/1907                   | 0.75 (0.64,0.87)       | f--e-1                       |                  |
| Sex                        |                            |                            |                        |                              |                  |
| Male                       | 253/1659                   | 297/1653                   | 0.81 (0.69,0.96)       | I----+----,                  |                  |
