    kg:section_title "Heart of protection *" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """that unifies the CRM landscape through early CV risk interventioncementing its role as the first choice across indications and advancing its leadership in an increasingly competitive market.

*This is internal, aspirational campaign language. Please do not use this copy in external materials.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:6c75e440-edc0-4030-8c77-926c3974943c> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:3387628e-6a54-4390-b0d0-acede25a6fbc>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:89416347-23bb-40dc-bb80-05aa142c9079> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 31 ;
    kg:section_id "6c75e440-edc0-4030-8c77-926c3974943c" ;
    kg:section_type "body" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Figure 4 Time to first event of kidney disease progression or adjudicated CV death, estimated cumulative incidence function

<!-- image -->

The results of the primary composite endpoint were generally consistent across the pre-specified subgroups, including eGFR categories, underlying cause of renal disease, diabetes status, or background use of RAS inhibitors. Treatment benefits were more clearly evident in patients with higher levels of albuminuria.

During treatment, eGFR decline over time was slower in the empagliflozin group compared to the placebo group (Figure 5). Empagliflozin slowed the annual rate of eGFR decline compared to placebo by 1.37 mL/min/1.73 m 2 /year (95% CI 1.16, 1.59), based on a pre-specified analysis of all eGFR measurements taken from the 2-month visit to the final follow-up visit. Patients treated with empagliflozin experienced an initial drop in eGFR which returned towards baseline after treatment discontinuation as demonstrated in several of the empagliflozin studies, supporting that haemodynamic changes play a role in the acute effects of empagliflozin on eGFR.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:6c99f884-6147-4d52-90a8-108ab60d6427> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:ba2ca0af-0c48-4138-861e-df2ec2d6cf8c> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 37 ;
    kg:section_id "6c99f884-6147-4d52-90a8-108ab60d6427" ;
    kg:section_title "Colour environment" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text "The colour environment includes not just the individual colours but also the relationship or ratio between the colours within the palette. For example, 2 brands may feature blue as a primary colour, but 1 brand may saturate the page in blue while the other may feature mostly white space punctuated by minimal blue accents. Same colour, very different colour environments. This is part of what makes the brand instantly recognisable and truly differentiated from its competitors." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:6d3bb492-5b07-4826-b05f-8c84ee9c8716> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:7d699827-c59f-4722-b27d-33f11dc93a4c> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 72 ;
    kg:section_id "6d3bb492-5b07-4826-b05f-8c84ee9c8716" ;
    kg:section_title "Crystallised brand promise in the logo cluster" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The crystallised brand promise is a fixed branding element. Even if the wording of the crystallised brand promise changes (eg, due to a change in positioning), where it is placed in the logo cluster does not change.

The GLYXAMBI logotype and registration mark appear in teal (PMS 321C).

<!-- image -->

The symbol appears in brown (PMS 411C), teal (PMS 321C), and magenta (PMS 219C).

The generic name appears in brown (PMS 411C).

To ensure brand consistency across all markets, the logo cluster must not be altered.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:6e8e9f19-0b50-42ea-9fd5-15a3af72ac59> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:79f1e5e1-8bf8-44ca-9224-ad125db0acd4> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 2 ;
