    kg:text "Each tablet contains 25 mg empagliflozin." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:6f1a8e4b-acfd-4b2f-ae70-7c217599212e> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8eadce73-6d71-4164-87df-98aa755898a0>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:fe96a485-1c4c-4d27-b445-76c012f8c5c4> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 43 ;
    kg:section_id "6f1a8e4b-acfd-4b2f-ae70-7c217599212e" ;
    kg:section_title "Important note" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Images are property of Boehringer Ingelheim is subject to the following restrictions:

Any third party acting on Boehringer's behalf, including but not limited to any third-party vendors, agencies, freelancer, partners or collaborators, are expressly prohibited from modifying, altering, adapting, or further processing Outputs including but not limited by using any third-party software, generative AI tools, or machine learning technologies. This includes, but is not limited to, uploading Outputs into external AI platforms, training models on content, or applying visual transformations such as symptom changes, facial edits, or environment alterations. These restrictions exist to ensure medical accuracy, character consistency, and regulatory compliance. The Outputs are to be used as final assets only and may not serve as editable base material for any further AI-driven content generation.

Patient imagery shown is available for download and use on the DAM:  T2D + eCVD (Joana), CKD (Erik, James), HFpEF (Linda), HFrEF (Robert)

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:6f8d1cd4-a078-4aef-944f-095b1e158302> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:e7d7c5ca-a789-4223-b8fc-cbf65b101c24> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 11 ;
    kg:section_id "6f8d1cd4-a078-4aef-944f-095b1e158302" ;
    kg:section_title "Increase in Hematocrit" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text "In a pool of four placebo-controlled trials in adults, median hematocrit decreased by 1.3% in placebo and increased by 2.8% in JARDIANCE 10 mg and 2.8% in JARDIANCE 25 mg treated patients.  At the end of treatment, 0.6%, 2.7%, and 3.5% of patients with hematocrits initially within the reference range had values above the upper limit of the reference range with placebo, JARDIANCE 10 mg, and JARDIANCE 25 mg, respectively." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:6ff36a3a-d2f6-48b1-812d-240c5ca947ab> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:65e6ce38-33bf-4887-8184-e1d3a60dc02c> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 3 ;
    kg:section_id "6ff36a3a-d2f6-48b1-812d-240c5ca947ab" ;
    kg:section_title "Renal impairment" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Due to limited experience, it is not recommended to initiate treatment with empagliflozin in patients with an eGFR &lt; 20 mL/min/1.73 m 2 .

In patients with an eGFR &lt; 60 mL/min/1.73 m 2 the daily dose of empagliflozin is 10 mg.

In patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus, the glucose lowering efficacy of empagliflozin is reduced in patients with an eGFR &lt; 45 mL/min/1.73 m 2  and likely absent in patients with an eGFR &lt; 30 mL/min/1.73 m 2 . Therefore, if eGFR falls below 45 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , additional glucose lowering treatment should be considered if needed (see sections 4.4, 4.8, 5.1 and 5.2).""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:7076ad58-2837-4a04-94c0-4aea1af45b39> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:2dba8a8b-2e01-4a51-90b3-a447400441f6> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 32 ;
    kg:section_id "7076ad58-2837-4a04-94c0-4aea1af45b39" ;
    kg:section_title "Heart failure and chronic kidney disease" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text "The European Medicines Agency has waived the obligation to submit the results of studies with Jardiance in all subsets of the paediatric population in heart failure and in the treatment of chronic kidney disease (see section 4.2 for information on paediatric use)." .

