<urn:kg:jardiance:section:745496c7-b701-428d-9f4f-0f37977b02e0> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:58ecb058-28ca-4c15-b734-3e221a045268>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:61999922-0fc7-45af-9338-fcc0efafcaf3>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:c258064d-2a38-4165-a155-7ddc1bccff31> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 4 ;
    kg:section_id "745496c7-b701-428d-9f4f-0f37977b02e0" ;
    kg:section_title "2.2  Recommended Dosage" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Table 1 presents the recommended dosage of JARDIANCE in adult and pediatric patients aged 10 years and older.

Table 1 Recommended Dosage of JARDIANCE

| Population                                 | Indication                                                                                                                                                                      | Recommended Dosage                                                                                                                                                                        |
|--------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Adults                                     | Reduce the risk of cardiovascular death and hospitalization in patients with heart failure                                                                                      | x 10 mg orally once daily in the morning, taken with or without food.                                                                                                                     |
| Adults                                     | Reduce the risk of sustained decline in eGFR, end-stage kidney disease, cardiovascular death, and hospitalization in adults with chronic kidney disease at risk of progression. | x 10 mg orally once daily in the morning, taken with or without food.                                                                                                                     |
| Adults                                     | Reduce the risk of cardiovascular death in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus with established cardiovascular disease                                                       | x 10 mg orally once daily in the morning, taken with or without food.                                                                                                                     |
| Adults                                     | Glycemic control in type 2 diabetes mellitus                                                                                                                                    | x 10 mg orally once daily in the morning, taken with or without food. x For additional glycemic control, may increase to 25 mg orally once daily in patients tolerating 10 mg once daily. |
| Pediatric patients aged 10 years and older | Glycemic control in type 2 diabetes mellitus                                                                                                                                    | x 10 mg orally once daily in the morning, taken with or without food. x For additional glycemic control, may increase to 25 mg orally once daily in patients tolerating 10 mg once daily. |""" .

