    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """JARDIANCE speaks to its readers/listeners much like a motivational coach who cares about his or her outcomes. JARDIANCE is not overly aggressive-it

<!-- image -->

is brave and energising and confident. The overall tone is optimistic and proactive, as JARDIANCE can deliver liberation to both patients and physicians-now and in the future.

<!-- image -->""" .

