    kg:text """- DON'T replace the doctor with any other imagery except what is supplied specifically for this campaign
- DON'T alter the crop of the hero's face beyond what is currently shown. Facial cropping should remain consistent across all pieces, while body cropping may vary as needed""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:a842bbf8-aab1-4fec-8005-85ba8328784b> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:12bf84fc-a155-42b7-a29e-5355dc704db2> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 27 ;
    kg:section_id "a842bbf8-aab1-4fec-8005-85ba8328784b" ;
    kg:section_type "body" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Figure 2 Time to first event of adjudicated CV death or HHF

<!-- image -->

The results of the primary composite endpoint were generally consistent with a hazard ratio (HR) below 1 across the pre-specified subgroups, including patients with heart failure, with or without type 2 diabetes mellitus and with or without renal impairment (down to an eGFR of 20 mL/min/1.73 m 2 ).""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:a958986f-e706-41f2-86e5-4dfccb6e594e> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:33330030-32cc-47bc-833f-baeb570297ab> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 16 ;
    kg:section_id "a958986f-e706-41f2-86e5-4dfccb6e594e" ;
    kg:section_title "Important note" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b" ;
    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Please ensure that the localized version of the campaign claim complies with all applicable local MLR requirements.

Translation : Keep translated copy, color, and placement as close as possible to the original. Changes should only be made if required by local MLR (Medical, Legal, Regulatory) standards.

Review Process : The localized headline must be reviewed with your Country Point of Contact (CPC), and MLR teams to confirm that it accurately reflects the campaign enhancement and is suitable for local use.

Documentation : Ensure that all materials are uploaded to the appropriate system with correct disclaimers, prescribing information, and translation certifications where applicable.

Final usage of the claim may depend on local market conditions and country-specific laws and requirements .""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:aa23cb55-fc24-45a4-a907-dfe2f13974de> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:813d897b-4acf-410d-a5c2-e69f3f2fd20c>,
        <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:cfccc40e-0b73-45aa-b595-c9d93c6480a8> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 50 ;
    kg:section_id "aa23cb55-fc24-45a4-a907-dfe2f13974de" ;
    kg:section_title "What are the ingredients in JARDIANCE?" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0" ;
    kg:source_document_type "prescribing_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Active Ingredient:

empagliflozin

Inactive Ingredients: colloidal silicon dioxide, croscarmellose sodium, hydroxypropyl cellulose, lactose monohydrate, magnesium stearate, and microcrystalline cellulose.  In addition, the film coating contains the following inactive ingredients: ferric oxide yellow, hypromellose, polyethylene glycol, talc, and titanium dioxide.

Distributed by: Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc.; Ridgefield, CT 06877 USA

Marketed by: Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc.; Ridgefield, CT 06877 USA and Eli Lilly and Company, Indianapolis, IN 46285 USA

Licensed from: Boehringer Ingelheim International GmbH, Ingelheim, Germany

JARDIANCE is a registered trademark of and used under license from Boehringer Ingelheim International GmbH.

Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc. either owns or uses the EMPA-REG OUTCOME ® , EMPEROR-Reduced ® , EMPEROR-Preserved ® , and EMPA-KIDNEY ® trademarks under license.

The other brands listed are trademarks of their respective owners and are not trademarks of Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc.

Copyright © 2025 Boehringer Ingelheim International GmbH ALL RIGHTS RESERVED

COL8914PI262025

For more information about JARDIANCE, including current prescribing information and Medication Guide, go to www.jardiance.com , scan the code, or call Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc. at 1-800-542-6257.

<!-- image -->

This Medication Guide has been approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.

Revised: October 2025""" .

