#: 1 | Final Corrected Claim: *Primary outcome was reduction in CV events defined as composite endpoint of CV death, nonfatal MI, or nonfatal stroke. JARDIANCE reduced the relative risk of such CV events by 14% | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Efficacy / Clinical benefit | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 14% | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.144 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA p.144
