#: 6 | Final Corrected Claim: *Change from baseline in clinical summary score (HF symptoms and physical limitations domains) of the KCCQ at week 52 was a prespecified secondary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Reduced and EMPEROR-Preserved trials. KCCQ change from baseline to 52 weeks. EMPEROR-Reduced: JARDIANCE 5.8 ± 0.4; placebo 4.1 ± 0.4. EMPEROR-Preserved: JARDIANCE  4.51, placebo 3.18. Patient-reported outcomes measured changes in KCCQ summary scores. | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Efficacy / Clinical benefit | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Study/programme: EMPEROR-Reduced | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.136 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA p.136
