<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d58c17eb-d603-4eeb-95af-885b45079c7b> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:17489cbe-00c4-44e4-9056-61514a2f6692> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 51 ;
    kg:section_id "d58c17eb-d603-4eeb-95af-885b45079c7b" ;
    kg:section_title "Kidney function" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text "Your kidneys should be checked before you start taking and whilst you are on this medicine." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d5b892d8-497c-4cd8-8d98-7086f33f38e0> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:0fbb8a7d-24d4-4c08-bf7d-03a3e16e12f0> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 52 ;
    kg:section_id "d5b892d8-497c-4cd8-8d98-7086f33f38e0" ;
    kg:section_title "3. How to take Jardiance" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text "Always take this medicine exactly as your doctor has told you. Check with your doctor or pharmacist if you are not sure." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d5de7e51-25cd-47f4-847d-80a99d4d79fb> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:99e57213-def2-496b-8e47-943dc28729a9> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 11 ;
    kg:section_id "d5de7e51-25cd-47f4-847d-80a99d4d79fb" ;
    kg:section_title "Increased urination" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Increased urination (including the predefined terms pollakiuria, polyuria, and nocturia) was observed at higher frequencies in patients treated with empagliflozin (empagliflozin 10 mg: 3.5%, empagliflozin 25 mg: 3.3%) compared to placebo (1.4%). Increased urination was mostly mild or moderate in intensity. The frequency of reported nocturia was similar for placebo and empagliflozin (&lt; 1%).

In the EMPEROR heart failure studies, increased urination was observed at similar frequencies in patients treated with empagliflozin and placebo (empagliflozin 10 mg: 0.9%, placebo 0.5%).""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d64094e3-5b03-4963-b19c-14cdd72dcdc1> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:542c449a-5486-4a60-ba99-1fee9ef97a71> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 51 ;
    kg:section_id "d64094e3-5b03-4963-b19c-14cdd72dcdc1" ;
    kg:section_title "Urine glucose" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text "Because of how this medicine works, your urine will test positive for sugar while you are taking this medicine." .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d7aa5df9-51be-4cc9-8074-350839411d7e> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:a239be01-78cb-4ee1-a69e-00bf85412e9d> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 6 ;
    kg:section_id "d7aa5df9-51be-4cc9-8074-350839411d7e" ;
    kg:section_title "Necrotising fasciitis of the perineum (Fournier's gangrene)" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Cases of necrotising fasciitis of the perineum, (also known as Fournier's gangrene), have been reported in female and male patients taking SGLT2 inhibitors, including empagliflozin. This is a rare but serious and potentially life-threatening event that requires urgent surgical intervention and antibiotic treatment.

Patients should be advised to seek medical attention if they experience a combination of symptoms of pain, tenderness, erythema, or swelling in the genital or perineal area, with fever or malaise. Be aware that either uro-genital infection or perineal abscess may precede necrotising fasciitis. If Fournier´s gangrene is suspected, Jardiance should be discontinued and prompt treatment (including antibiotics and surgical debridement) should be instituted.""" .

<urn:kg:jardiance:section:d7dcd5c5-d899-46d6-9f75-485fb9b6c99e> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Jardiance_PI.pdf" ;
