    kg:section_type "body" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Table 3: Efficacy results of 24 week placebo-controlled studies a

|                                                              | Add-on to metformin therapy                     | Add-on to metformin therapy                     | Add-on to metformin therapy                     |
|--------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------|
|                                                              | Placebo                                         | 10 mg                                           | 25 mg                                           |
| N                                                            | 207                                             | 217                                             | 213                                             |
| HbA1c (%)                                                    |                                                 |                                                 |                                                 |
| Baseline (mean)                                              | 7.90                                            | 7.94                                            | 7.86                                            |
| Change from baseline 1                                       | -0.13                                           | -0.70                                           | -0.77                                           |
