    kg:section_id "b9b6bedd-2c81-45d4-aec9-4e0963368e04" ;
    kg:section_title "4.7 Effects on ability to drive and use machines" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40" ;
    kg:source_document_type "product_information" ;
    kg:source_file_name "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf" ;
    kg:text "Jardiance has minor influence on the ability to drive and use machines. Patients should be advised to take precautions to avoid hypoglycaemia while driving and using machines, in particular when Jardiance is used in combination with a sulphonylurea and/or insulin." .

