    kg:data "{\"sheet_name\": \"Final Corrected Claims\", \"columns\": [\"#\", \"Final Corrected Claim\", \"Status\", \"Indication\", \"Key Message Type\", \"End Audience\", \"Contextual Information\", \"Footnotes\", \"Reference\", \"Note\"], \"rows\": [{\"row_number\": 2, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"1\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"*Primary outcome was reduction in CV events defined as composite endpoint of CV death, nonfatal MI, or nonfatal stroke. JARDIANCE reduced the relative risk of such CV events by 14%\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 14% | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.144 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA p.144\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 3, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"2\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"*Positively reinforcing continued use of JARDIANCE may significantly reduce the risk of CV death.1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.117 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.117\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 4, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"3\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Initiate JARDIANCE first line to reduce your patients’ risk of CV death\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.50 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.50\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 5, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"4\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"†JARDIANCE helps protect patients by reducing the risk of CV death.1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.116; 2026 Card iVA p.119 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.116; 2026 Card iVA p.119\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 6, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"5\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"#JARDIANCE helps protect patients by reducing CV risk.5\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.107 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"5\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.107\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 7, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"6\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"*Change from baseline in clinical summary score (HF symptoms and physical limitations domains) of the KCCQ at week 52 was a prespecified secondary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Reduced and EMPEROR-Preserved trials. KCCQ change from baseline to 52 weeks. EMPEROR-Reduced: JARDIANCE 5.8 ± 0.4; placebo 4.1 ± 0.4. EMPEROR-Preserved: JARDIANCE  4.51, placebo 3.18. Patient-reported outcomes measured changes in KCCQ summary scores.\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Study/programme: EMPEROR-Reduced | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.136 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA p.136\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 8, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"7\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Initiate JARDIANCE to reduce your patients’ risk of CV death and protect them right from the start\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.53 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.53\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 9, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"8\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Initiate JARDIANCE today to start your patients with sustained CV protection#5\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.106 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"5\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.106\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 10, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"9\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE acts fast in the first line to deliver long-term cardioprotection* for a wide range of patients6,7\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.24; 2026 Card iVA p.66; 2026 Card iVA p.102 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"6,7\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.24; 2026 Card iVA p.66; 2026 Card iVA p.102\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 11, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"10\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE demonstrated consistent efficacy across subgroups1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.140 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.140\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 12, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"11\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE helped reduce the risk of incident or worsening nephropathy†1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.95 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"†1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.95\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 13, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"12\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE helps protect patients by giving more time ​out of hospital1,2​\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.183 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.183\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 14, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"13\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE helps protect the kidneys by slowing the decline in kidney \\nfunction across the LVEF spectrum\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.162 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.162\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 15, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"14\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE led to significant improvements in mean KCCQ-CSS, -TSS, and -OSS, which were apparent as early as 3 months and were sustained at 8 and 12 months.\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.136 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA p.136\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 16, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"15\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE provides powerful CV and kidney protection* as demonstrated in multiple clinical trials spanning a decade\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.20; 2026 PCP iVA p.28 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.20; 2026 PCP iVA p.28\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 17, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"16\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE reduced the need for insulin initiation||||8\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.28 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"8\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.28\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 18, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"17\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE reduces the risk of first and recurrent hospitalisation in HF1,2\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.93; 2026 PCP iVA p.113 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1,2\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.93; 2026 PCP iVA p.113\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 19, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"18\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE reduces the risk of incident or worsening nephropathy†1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.149 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"†1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.149\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 20, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"19\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE: The once-daily tablet for CV protection†\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.44; 2026 Card iVA p.87; 2026 Card iVA p.116 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.44; 2026 Card iVA p.87; 2026 Card iVA p.116\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 21, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"20\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 21% RRR in this endpoint (HR=0.79; 95% CI: 0.69, 0.90; p<0.001)\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 21% | Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 22, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"21\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 25% RRR in this endpoint (HR=0.75; 95% CI: 0.65, 0.86; p<0.001)\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 25% | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 23, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"22\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 28% RRR in this endpoint (HR=0.72; 95% CI: 0.64, 0.82; p<0.001).1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 28%; 95%; HR=0.72; 95% CI: 0; p<0.001 | Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.78; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104; 2026 Card iVA p.181; 2026 PCP iVA p.41 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.78; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104; 2026 Card iVA p.181; 2026 PCP iVA p.41\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 24, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"23\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Patients treated with JARDIANCE were more likely to show clinically meaningful improvements (≥5, ≥10, and ≥15 points) and less likely to experience clinically meaningful deterioration in health status when compared to placebo.1,2,4,5\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.136 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1,2,4,5\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA p.136\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 25, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"24\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"You can initiate JARDIANCE early for the greatest kidney benefit,\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.40 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.40\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 26, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"25\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Offer your patients across the LVEF spectrum significant  benefits as early as 2 weeks with JARDIANCE\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.110 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"3,4\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.110\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 27, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"26\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"§JARDIANCE helps protect by reducing CV and kidney risk.1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.12; 2026 Endo iVA p.46; 2026 Endo iVA p.53 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.12; 2026 Endo iVA p.46; 2026 Endo iVA p.53\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 28, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"27\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"§JARDIANCE helps protect patients by reducing CV and kidney risk.1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.50 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.50\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 29, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"28\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE significantly improved quality of life regardless of LVEF4,5\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.134 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"4,5\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.134\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 30, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"29\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Reduce the risk of hospitalisation for HF by adding JARDIANCE\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.109; 2026 PCP iVA p.92 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Card iVA p.109; 2026 PCP iVA p.92\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 31, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"30\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"The effect of empagliflozin to reduce the combined risk of death, hospitalisation for heart failure, or an emergent or urgent heart failure visit was statistically significant at 12 days after randomisation and statistical significance was sustained from day 12 onward (HR=0.70; 95% CI: 0.63, 0.78; p<0.0001).3\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 95%; HR=0.70; 95% CI: 0; p<0.0001 | Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.91; 2026 PCP iVA p.111 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"3\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.91; 2026 PCP iVA p.111\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 32, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"31\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"*Positively reinforcing continued use of JARDIANCE may significantly reduce the risk of CV death or HHF.1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.45; 2026 Card iVA p.88 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.45; 2026 Card iVA p.88\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 33, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"32\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE protects your patients by reducing the risk of CV death or HHF†1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.69 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"†1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.69\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 34, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"33\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE reduced CV death or HHF across a broad age spectrum1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.37; 2026 Card iVA p.79 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.37; 2026 Card iVA p.79\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 35, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"34\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE reduced CV death or HHF regardless of baseline frailty status\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.80 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.80\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 36, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"35\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE: the 1st medicine‡ to protect patients across the LVEF spectrum by reducing the risk of CV death and hospitalisation for HF1,2\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.54 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1,2\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.54\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 37, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"36\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"†JARDIANCE helps protect patients by reducing the risk of CV death or HHF.1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.44; 2026 Card iVA p.47; 2026 Card iVA p.87; 2026 Card iVA p.90 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.44; 2026 Card iVA p.47; 2026 Card iVA p.87; 2026 Card iVA p.90\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 38, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"37\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE helped protect patients by giving more time out of hospital1,2 In the treatment of patients with CKD with or without T2D*\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.79 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.79\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 39, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"38\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE reduced risk of CV death regardless of patients’ HbA1c or BMI#5,7\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.27 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"5,7\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.27\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 40, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"39\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Prescribe JARDIANCE to reduce the risk of CV death for your patients with eCVD + T2D\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.103 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.103\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 41, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"40\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE protects a wide range of patients regardless of T2D or CKD status, by reducing the risk of CV death or HHF1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Efficacy / Clinical benefit\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.165; 2026 Card iVA p.168 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.165; 2026 Card iVA p.168\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 42, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"41\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE is indicated in adults for the treatment of chronic kidney disease.\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Indication / Use\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.3; 2026 Card iVA p.3; 2026 PCP iVA p.3 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.3; 2026 Card iVA p.3; 2026 PCP iVA p.3\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 43, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"42\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE is contraindicated in patients with hypersensitivity to the active substance or to any of the excipients of JARDIANCE. JARDIANCE should not be used in patients with type 1 diabetes or for the treatment of DKA.\\\"\\n\\nHowever, the first sentence alone also we can consider as a claim\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Indication / Use\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.54; 2026 Card iVA p.48; 2026 Card iVA p.91; 2026 Card iVA p.120; 2026 PCP iVA p.51 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.54; 2026 Card iVA p.48; 2026 Card iVA p.91; 2026 Card iVA p.120; 2026 PCP iVA p.51\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 44, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"43\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE is indicated in adults for the treatment of symptomatic chronic heart failure.\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Indication / Use\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.3; 2026 Card iVA p.3; 2026 PCP iVA p.3 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.3; 2026 Card iVA p.3; 2026 PCP iVA p.3\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 45, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"44\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE is indicated in adults and children aged 10 years and above for the treatment of insufficiently controlled type 2 diabetes mellitus as an adjunct to diet and exercise\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Indication / Use\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.3; 2026 Card iVA p.3; 2026 PCP iVA p.3 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.3; 2026 Card iVA p.3; 2026 PCP iVA p.3\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 46, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"45\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"In the treatment of patients with T2D and eCVD Early intervention is key to reducing the risk of cardio-renal complications\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.8 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1-3\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.8\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 47, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"46\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Treat your patients with CKD urgently to manage their rising CVD mortality risk1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.7 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.7\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 48, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"47\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"EMPA-KIDNEY trial: Reduction in the risk of kidney disease progression or CV death\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Study/programme: EMPA-KIDNEY | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.77; 2026 PCP iVA p.38 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.77; 2026 PCP iVA p.38\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 49, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"48\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"EMPA-KIDNEY trial: Reduction in the risk of kidney disease progression or CV death1,3\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Study/programme: EMPA-KIDNEY | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.180 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1,3\", \"Reference\": \"EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.180\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 50, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"49\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Reduced eGFR is associated with increased risk of all-cause mortality, CV death, and hospitalisation in patients with HF\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.57 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"4\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.57\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 51, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"50\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"EMPA-REG OUTCOME® trial: Early and sustained reductions in the risk of CV death5\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Study/programme: EMPA-REG OUTCOME | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.106 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"5\", \"Reference\": \"EMPA-REG OUTCOME | 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.106\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 52, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"51\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"EMPA-REG OUTCOME® trial: Early and sustained reductions in the risk of CV death5 Reducing the risk of CV death can help your patients get more time with their loved ones5\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Study/programme: EMPA-REG OUTCOME | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.26; 2026 PCP iVA p.31 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"5\", \"Reference\": \"EMPA-REG OUTCOME | 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.26; 2026 PCP iVA p.31\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 53, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"52\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"The 14% RRR in 3-point MACE (HR=0.86; 95% CI: 0.74, 0.99; p<0.001 for noninferiority; p=0.04 for superiority) was driven by a reduction in the risk of CV death (HR=0.62; 95% CI: 0.49, 0.77); there was no change in risk of nonfatal MI (HR=0.87; 95% CI: 0.70, 1.09) or nonfatal stroke (HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0.92, 1.67).1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 14%; 95%; HR=0.86; HR=0.62; HR=0.87; HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0; p<0.001; p=0.04 | Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 54, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"53\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE is a guideline-recommended option that can help your patients by reducing their risk of CV death\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.41 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.41\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 55, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"54\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Contraindications and precautions \\n• JARDIANCE should not be used for the treatment of patients with: \\n– Type 1 diabetes \\n– Severe hepatic impairment \\n– Hypersensitivity to the active substance or to any of the excipients \\n• In patients 75 years and older, an increased risk of volume depletion should be taken into account \\n• Due to limited experience, it is not recommended to initiate treatment with empagliflozin in patients with an eGFR <20 mL/min/1.73 m2\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.37; 2026 PCP iVA p.47 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.37; 2026 PCP iVA p.47\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 56, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"55\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"EMPA-KIDNEY: the largest SGLT2i kidney trial to date evaluated JARDIANCE across the broadest spectrum of patients with declining kidney function\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.74; 2026 Card iVA p.177; 2026 PCP iVA p.76 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.74; 2026 Card iVA p.177; 2026 PCP iVA p.76\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 57, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"56\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE significantly: Reduced the risk of hospitalisation, so patients can spend more time out of the hospital\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.133 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.133\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 58, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"57\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Your patients with HF require urgent and appropriate intervention with foundational treatments, like SGLT2is\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.60 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.60\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 59, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"58\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"The reductions in risk of CV death or HHF, respectively were consistent in patients with or without HF at baseline\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.110 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"3\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.110\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 60, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"59\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, are Class I recommended for first-line use in patients with CVD + T2D to reduce the risk of CV events, independent of glucose control\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.99 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.99\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 61, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"60\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"GDMT is typically not optimised for patients with HFrEF2,3\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.126 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"2,3\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.126\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 62, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"61\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Your patients with HFpEF require urgent and appropriate intervention with foundational treatments like SGLT2is2\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.63 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.63\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 63, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"62\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"As an SGLT2i, JARDIANCE is a Class I, Level A-recommended therapy for patients with HFmrEF and HFpEF to reduce the risk of heart failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.25 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.25\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 64, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"63\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"SGLT2is are a Class I, Level A-recommended therapy for patients with HFrEF to reduce the risk of heart failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death, making JARDIANCE 1 of 4 foundational treatments for HFrEF.\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.25 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.25\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 65, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"64\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"In patients with HFrEF JARDIANCE helps keep your patients out of the hospital by reducing the risk of first and recurrent HHF\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.30 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.30\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 66, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"65\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"‡In addition to the RRR of all HHF, including first and recurrent events, the risk of total hospitalisations for any reason was also significantly reduced (HR=0.85; 95% CI: 0.75, 0.95).1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 95%; HR=0.85; 95% CI: 0 | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.94; 2026 PCP iVA p.114 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.94; 2026 PCP iVA p.114\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 67, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"66\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"The primary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Preserved trial was a composite of CV death or hospitalisation for HF, analysed as time to the first event.\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 68, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"67\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"The primary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Reduced trial was a composite of CV death or hospitalisation for HF, analysed as time to the first event.\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 69, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"68\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"SGLT2is are a Class I, Level A-recommended therapy for patients with HFrEF to reduce the risk of heart failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death, making JARDIANCE 1 of 4 foundational treatments for HFrEF. (Alternatively: As an SGLT2i, JARDIANCE is a Class I, Level A-recommended therapy for patients with HFmrEF and HFpEF to reduce the risk of heart failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death)\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.17; 2026 Card iVA p.62 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.17; 2026 Card iVA p.62\", \"Note\": \"Source lists two related claims on this topic; both variants shown - confirm which applies to this specific asset context\"}}, {\"row_number\": 70, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"69\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"CVD is the #1 cause of death in patients with T2D1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.93 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.93\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 71, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"70\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Optimised treatment should go beyond HbA1c reduction and help protect your patients with T2D and CVD\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.8 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"3\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.8\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 72, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"71\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Rates of hypoglycaemia‡ were similar between JARDIANCE and placebo in patients with or without T2D\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.96; 2026 Card iVA p.171; 2026 PCP iVA p.116 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1,2\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.96; 2026 Card iVA p.171; 2026 PCP iVA p.116\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 73, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"72\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, are Class I recommended for first-line use in patients with CVD + T2D to reduce the risk of CV events\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.17; 2026 Card iVA p.62 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.17; 2026 Card iVA p.62\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 74, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"73\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"In the treatment of patients with CKD with or without T2D Serious adverse events seen in the EMPA-KIDNEY trial\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.81; 2026 PCP iVA p.82 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.81; 2026 PCP iVA p.82\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 75, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"74\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Patients with hypertension or T2D are at risk for CKD2,3\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.8 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"2,3\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.8\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 76, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"75\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"EMPA-REG OUTCOME® focused on patients with eCVD + T2D2,8\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Study/programme: EMPA-REG OUTCOME | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.103 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"2,8\", \"Reference\": \"EMPA-REG OUTCOME | 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.103\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 77, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"76\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"In insulin-treated patients with T2D and eCVD JARDIANCE reduced the need for large increases in insulin dose\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.29\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 78, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"77\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"In the treatment of patients with T2D and eCVD\\nEarly intervention is key to reducing the risk of cardio-renal complications'\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.8; 2026 PCP iVA p.98 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.8; 2026 PCP iVA p.98\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 79, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"78\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Patients saw consistent reduction in risk of CV death regardless of HbA1c or BMI \\nat baseline, and independent of change in HbA1c\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.27 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.27\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 80, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"79\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Subgroup analyses highlighted below: reduction in risk of CV death across HbA1c and BMI subgroups\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.27 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.27\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 81, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"80\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"JARDIANCE is the first and only SGLT2i proven to reduce the risk \\nof CV death in patients with T2D + eCVD\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.26; 2026 PCP iVA p.31 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"‡1-4\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.26; 2026 PCP iVA p.31\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 82, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"81\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"patients with T2D are at increased risk of CV death1-3\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.5 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"1-3\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.5\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 83, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"82\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"†Key inclusion criteria: adult patients with type 2 diabetes and eCVD (CAD, PAD, or a history of MI or stroke), HbA1c 7%-10%, BMI ≤45 kg/m2. Key exclusion criteria:\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Disease education / Unmet need\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 7%; 10% | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.144 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.144\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 84, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"83\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"Due to limited experience, it is not recommended to initiate treatment with empagliflozin in patients with an eGFR <20 mL/min/1.73 m2\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Guideline / Standard of care\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.37; 2026 PCP iVA p.47 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"2\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.37; 2026 PCP iVA p.47\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 85, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"84\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"It is not recommended to initiate JARDIANCE at eGFR level <20mL/min/1.73 m2\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Guideline / Standard of care\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.47; 2026 PCP iVA p.44 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.47; 2026 PCP iVA p.44\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 86, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"85\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"KDIGO guidelines recommend 2 tests (uACR and eGFR) annually in at-risk individuals to adequately assess for kidney damage\", \"Status\": \"Corrected\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Guideline / Standard of care\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.8 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.8\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 87, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"86\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"§NNT: 28 (95% CI: 19, 53) per 2 years at risk.2 IIStandard of care: All patients received a RAASi unless an investigator judged that a RAASi was not indicated or tolerated.1 ¶The rate of annual eGFR decline was a prespecified tertiary endpoint of the EMPA-KIDNEY trial.1 #Estimated from each baseline eGFR value by applying the chronic eGFR slopes corresponding to participants on placebo vs JARDIANCE within the prespecified eGFR subgroups (eGFR\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"Chronic kidney disease\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Guideline / Standard of care\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Quantitative detail: 95%; 95% CI: 19 | Study/programme: EMPA-KIDNEY | Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.41 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.\", \"Footnotes\": \"See source asset footnotes and local label.\", \"Reference\": \"EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.41\", \"Note\": null}}, {\"row_number\": 88, \"cells\": {\"#\": \"87\", \"Final Corrected Claim\": \"*Standard of care included CV medications and glucose-lowering agents given at the discretion of healthcare providers and according to recommendations of local guidelines.1\", \"Status\": \"Confirmed complete\", \"Indication\": \"General\", \"Key Message Type\": \"Guideline / Standard of care\", \"End Audience\": \"HCP/Internal\", \"Contextual Information\": \"Specialty c